{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_13_level_main_13-13_end",
  "groupId": "main_13",
  "stageId": "main_13-13",
  "title": "短暫齊聚",
  "storyCode": "13-15",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-13_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "76f09617395f48cf2351651aee52e61620c0463fec9e650c39b5c0544a1220c4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Dr.{@nickname}，等這場戰爭結束，我想再回一次卡茲戴爾。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
          "text": "停車，前方有異常情況。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
          "text": "所有人，做好戰鬥準備。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "那是——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "“司機”",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "唔——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "“司機”",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "——這種感覺，我們之前檢修那些法陣的時候也偶爾遇到過。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "“司機”",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "女妖閣下，這到底是……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
          "text": "開戰之後，誰也沒有想到，這片土地被如此迅速地澆灌了這麼多的鮮血。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
          "text": "……“現代戰爭”，呵。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
          "text": "血魔恐怕已經等到了儀式需要的所有條件。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
          "text": "之前那些戰地中的晶石僅是與儀式共振的節點，這一路上，我都在尋找儀式的中心。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
          "text": "布倫特伍德，這座小鎮，在血魔晦暗的計劃中，必然有特殊的地位。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "Logos先生，你能處理嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
          "text": "這是鮮血王庭的古老手段，他們也確實為此做了充足準備。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
          "text": "我需要更多時間。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "我們還沒暴露行蹤，也許能爭取些時間，但——等等——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "那是？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "……火光？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "小鎮裡有交戰的火光……會是誰？"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "看來他們比我們先一步抵達了這裡。\n一場有些波折的會師。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "“礦工”",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
          "text": "女妖閣下，您……要去做什麼？您是要處理我們的敵人，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "“礦工”",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
          "text": "這裡，這種力量——難道不是那位血魔閣下，對於全體薩卡茲的賜福嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "“礦工”",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
          "text": "他……祝福了我們的血脈。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "那個……女妖閣下，我也感覺到自己……似乎變強了一點點。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "腕力？還是頭腦？我自己都不知道，但是總感覺有種……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "……增強力量的巫術祭壇。我們曾經見過。但無論是規模還是給人的感覺，都遠不相同。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "Logos先生，這會不會有什麼負面的……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
          "text": "很意外。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
          "text": "並不需要支付代價，起碼這份代價，並不是由我們自己的軀體支付。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "那您為什麼——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
          "text": "明椒，對吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
          "text": "你希望這份力量被用在什麼地方？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我……"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "薩卡茲戰士們越善戰，戰場上澆灌鮮血的效率就越高。無論是他們敵人的，還是自己的。\n儀式就能夠得以延續。\n血魔大君已經在為決戰做準備了，可是他們……特雷西斯的布置，真的僅僅是這麼一個儀式？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
          "text": "法陣似乎已經受到了攻擊，伴生的血魔造物正在失控。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "這裡交給我們吧，Logos先生。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "請您先去確認儀式的情況。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
          "text": "阿米婭，你與博士可以和我一起行動。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "我們會盡快。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
          "text": "……明白了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "那個——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "你們打算把我們怎麼樣？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "明椒小姐？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "我其實之前就發現了，真正被俘的，是我們，對嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "我太熟悉王庭軍的那群傢伙了，你們給人的感覺完全不同。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "你是叫阿米婭，對吧？你和這位博士，才是你們這支隊伍的領袖。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "你明明……看起來和我差不多大。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "我能感覺到，那位女妖的地位並不普通，這造不了假。但他為你們效力？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "前些日子，我還遇到過一位自稱是薩卡茲的卡普里尼女士……她也是你們的成員嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "你們到底是誰？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "你打算和我們戰鬥嗎，明椒小姐？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "我……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "……唉，其實我不清楚。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "“老財”",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "隊長，那位女妖閣下怎麼走了？現在我們怎麼辦？地上的裂縫向我們蔓延過來了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "“司機”",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "這兩個俘虜怎麼被留下了？來自王庭的大人物這麼信任我們？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "啊……是啊！你們在那個方向做好警戒！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "我看著這兩個人！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "你們的力量也許變強了，但你們並不熟悉戰鬥。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "或者說，你們誰都沒準備好參與這場戰爭。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "……是啊。這麼長時間了，我們難道不知道嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "我是運輸小隊的隊長！如果你們要做什麼，就先拿我開刀好了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "他們只是從泰拉各地響應殿下號召，捲進這場戰爭的普通人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "他們甚至只是在執行曼弗雷德將軍委派的運輸任務，完全不清楚自己在做什麼——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "從他們響應號召起……維多利亞人就不會再認為他們是普通人，明椒小姐。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "這和他們做了什麼並沒有關係。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "他們是將軍交到我手上的隊員，無論發生什麼，我會保護他們的安全，阿米婭小姐。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "這是我對曼弗雷德將軍的承諾。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "……將軍，是嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "那至少現在，讓我們一起，解決掉眼前的這些失控的血液造物。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "把你的隊伍叫回來吧，明椒小姐，別心存僥倖，這些造物會吸乾任何它們看見的血液。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "博士，跟緊我。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "我會用我的力量，為我們，為他們開路。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "小兔子，其實有種更快的方式堵死那些裂縫。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "W小姐？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "“砰，砰，砰！”"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "你，你們……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "薩卡茲雇傭兵？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "腳下留神，毛線球，你站的可不是個好地方。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "啊——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我建議你在那個瘋子扔炸彈的時候離她遠點，W可不是什麼善良的薩卡茲寶寶適合接觸的對象。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "呃，伊內絲小姐？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "謝謝你，還有，阿米——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "……等等，你的頭上，那是……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "“黑色的王冠”？你是曼弗雷德將軍說過的……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "聽說，曼弗雷德撿了個孩子，看來就是你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "這幾個薩卡茲也已經被我控制。你是他們的隊長吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "“礦工”",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
          "text": "喂，放開我！你……你到底是誰？你想幹什麼？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "“司機”",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我們在為軍事委員會和王庭的大人物執行任務！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "剛好，我為他們整頓紀律。"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你好，阿米婭。當然，還有……\n博士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "赫德雷先生……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "怎麼，第一次正式面對面交流，是不是覺得很失望？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "他當反派的時間確實要比當自己人的時間長了，我也不適應呢。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "不。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "感謝您的幫助，赫德雷先生，其他事情我們可以之後再談。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "如您所見，這座小鎮正成為一場爭奪戰的中心。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "確實。我們有些重要的情報需要和你們共享。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "關於這座小鎮，和藏在它的陰影裡的，“生命線”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "有兩支部隊正在進攻那裡的薩卡茲駐軍，一支是可露希爾從倫蒂尼姆帶出來的那些自救軍。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "哼，看來我的安全屋是被糟蹋了，但願那老女人沒什麼好下場。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "另一支是由曾隸屬不同公爵的軍人組成的部隊……還有一些，難民和工人模樣的人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "一支不像樣的軍隊，而他們的領導人是——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊內絲",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "推進之王。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "“老財”",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
          "text": "啊——救命——唔，唔——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "“司機”",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "噓！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "“礦工”",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
          "text": "別吭聲，*薩卡茲粗口*。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "“老財”",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
          "text": "這是哪……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "“老財”",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
          "text": "維多利亞人？！還有……薩卡茲傭兵？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "別怕，我還在這。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "明椒",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "情況，呃，確實有點複雜，但是聽我的，準沒錯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你們不會還想在後面的計劃裡繼續帶著這些累贅吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "“老財”",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
          "text": "誰是累贅？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "W小姐，我答應過明椒小姐不會傷害他們。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "羅德島，呵，老樣子。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "那就讓他們先和跟著我的那些傭兵們待在一起吧，那些傢伙已經無所事事得夠久了，正好給他們帶帶新人，找點樂子。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你覺得怎麼樣，藍毛菲林，你瞪著我們好久了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "想把我們都殺了，你可以直接動手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……不動手？嘖嘖。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你們願意繼續僵持在這裡我是無所謂，這些人我先帶走了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "在這待著心煩。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "對了，伊內絲，要是你們和維多利亞人打起來，別忘了提前通知我一聲，我不想錯過好戲。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "戴菲恩小姐……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
          "text": "阿米婭。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
          "text": "你……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
          "text": "沒事就好。我很擔心，真的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
          "text": "我……阿米婭小姐，抱歉。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
          "text": "我願意相信羅德島挑選合作對象的標準。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
          "text": "只是……我想……我也是情報人員。我對這位“赫德雷”不是一無所知。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
          "text": "我對他……不，甚至是對Misery，對伊內絲，這一路上我都止不住去想……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
          "text": "我還無法接受這件事，暫時沒辦法。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
          "text": "……不，也許我根本沒辦法接受。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
          "text": "但是眼下，我說過了，我相信維娜的判斷。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
          "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
          "text": "如果這是現在我們要做的，那就去做。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "這些傷痕不會被遺忘，也不該被遺忘。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "所以薩卡茲的戰爭從未在這片大地上結束過，菲林。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "掐斷軍事委員會的補給線，確實是我們一直以來的目的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "無論如何，這都是讓戰爭迅速結束的辦法。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "但是這隻“巨獸”……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……我知道你在想什麼。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "在各方據點都不再安全的現在，這具骸骨可以成為我們反攻倫蒂尼姆的倚仗。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我們無法與任何一支軍事力量正面抗衡，更無法輕易躲開那艘飛空艇幾近無可匹敵的火力覆蓋……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "那麼，這個“飄忽不定”的巨獸，就是最適合我們的載具，同時也是壁壘，甚至是一柄直達心臟的長矛。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "既然如此，如果我們成功了，它自然屬於這場反攻戰的領導人們，而不是……“薩卡茲雇傭兵”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……我們似乎沒有拒絕合作的理由。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "“但是”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "但是。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "從理性的角度，我明白薩卡茲與薩卡茲之間並不等同，“典範軍”也確實與身為薩卡茲的Misery先生配合無間，但……這是個人的友誼。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我們也許能去尊敬，能去信任，甚至能去愛幾個具體的人，但現在在我們面前的是一場每一方手上都沾滿了血的戰爭。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "如果我們有足夠的時間，也許可以逐一探究犯下了戰爭罪行的到底是哪些人，又有哪些人清白無辜，但這不可能。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "這是一場死局，赫德雷先生。我們的合作不會那麼順利。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "正因如此，我們在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "羅德島會作為兩方之間的調停者和溝通者行使職能。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "為了維多利亞的人民不再受戰爭之苦，為了卡茲戴爾的薩卡茲不再繼續被拖入深淵，這是再合理不過了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "我們不必強求握手言和，把一切都留到停下這場荒唐的戰爭之後吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "口號是無力的，最後停下這一切的，只會是我們的行動。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……羅德島就是這樣的地方。聽說赫德雷先生過去就和羅德島有接觸？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你提到了那隻巨獸停靠的位置，有大量薩卡茲的駐軍。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "但是從計劃的合理性來說，少量精銳要好過……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "好過工人和街頭混混們正面送死，是吧？你可以把話說直白點，我沒那麼在意。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "但跟著我的傢伙們，不會錯過任何能揍翻薩卡茲的機會。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我們的戰車會幫你們吸引駐軍的火力。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "足夠了，多謝。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……阿米婭小姐。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "這是我們第一次正式合作，與“羅德島”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "是的，赫德雷先生。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "但是，請容許我問您一個問題……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "當然。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "您的困擾和擔憂，您剛才沒說出口。您心底裡的想法……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "是為了拯救更多的生命，制止戰爭和仇恨，對嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我聽說，魔王可以輕易地洞察人心，和伊內絲那樣模稜兩可的感覺不同。我應該瞞不住你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "我尊重一位從巴別塔時期掙扎奮鬥至今的薩卡茲。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "我希望您以您的意志回答。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……原來如此。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "是的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我會……爭取那個未來。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "謝謝您的答案，也，謝謝您的信任。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "Logos先生，凱爾希醫生，你們回來了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
          "text": "我分析了血魔的儀式，令人擔憂。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
          "text": "這確實是關乎血脈的賜福，使用的技藝古老而精準。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
          "text": "大君借用巫術的力量，收集戰爭中流淌的血，以此活化薩卡茲戰士們的血統。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
          "text": "他無時無刻不在提醒薩卡茲與其他種族本質上的不同，除去增幅，更似勸誘。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
          "text": "但最重要的是……恐怕這只佔他在此收集的力量的一小部分。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
          "text": "更多的能量去向不明。我嘗試追蹤，但法術結構複雜凌亂，只指向倫蒂尼姆。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "他在搞什麼把戲？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
          "text": "以及，這提醒了我。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
          "text": "此時此刻，戰場中心，有一位比血魔更善於汲取並利用死亡的薩卡茲領袖。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
          "text": "如果真的只是“增幅士兵”，那又如何輪得到鮮血王庭的巫術？又為什麼要選擇法陣這種形制？還連戰爭邊緣的村鎮都不放過？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "結論是？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "飛空艇，巨獸，碎片大廈，還有眼前的巫術裝置。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "博士的擔憂是對的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "如你所說，那隻巨獸會是我們最重要的突破口，行動必須盡快開始。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "血魔也好，食腐者也罷，還有赦罪師反常地暴露在夜鶯的面前，他們都在鋌而走險。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "戰爭不是無緣無故在此時打響。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "……特雷西斯在倫蒂尼姆還準備了最後的殺手鐧。是啊，篡奪一國首都，本就荒誕不經……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "可，會是什麼？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "先讓我從一個基本的問題，開始解釋。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "連薩卡茲自身都已經忘記了的，最基本的問題。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "“為什麼薩卡茲是最容易感染礦石病的種族？”"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
